{%- comment -%}
  theinmag-stockist-kit
  The stockist kit: free promo assets for the shops that stock theINmag.
  v1 2026-10-14 (mock). v2 2026-10-24: rebuilt as a visual-first, gallery-wall
  page on Ryan's brief ("high quality, arty, architectural, less writing, more
  visuals; download single files OR the set").

  Groups, numbered 01-05, each with its own "Download all" (a zip built in the
  browser with JSZip, loaded only on the first click):
    01 Covers     AUTOMATIC from the issues collection, newest first. Newest
                  cover runs large. Inside spreads zip per issue.
    02 Ready to post   blocks of type "social" (square tiles, cover reveals).
    03 Photos     blocks "photo" + "video" in a 4px-grout mosaic, sharp edges.
    04 Logos      blocks "logo" on a hairline specimen grid.
    05 Words      blocks "blurb": copy-to-clipboard text.

  Every file is served from the shop's own domain (/cdn/shop/...), so the
  download attribute is honoured and fetch() can read it for the zip. The
  video is a single download only, never inside a zip (size).

  Kid-IP rule: covers are used whole. No photo with an identifiable kid's face
  without Ryan's say-so (consent check).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign coll_handle = section.settings.issues_collection | default: 'single-issues'
  assign coll = collections[coll_handle]
  assign logos = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'logo'
  assign socials = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'social'
  assign blurbs = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'blurb'
  comment
    Photos and clips come from the media_list setting, one item per line,
    because a section is capped at 50 blocks and the kit has more than that:
      photo <Shopify Files filename> | caption
      clip <mp4 URL on our domain> | caption
      asset <theme asset filename> | caption
  endcomment
  assign media_lines = section.settings.media_list | newline_to_br | split: '<br />'
  assign n_photos = 0
  assign n_clips = 0
  for ml in media_lines
    assign mlt = ml | strip
    if mlt contains 'clip '
      assign n_clips = n_clips | plus: 1
    elsif mlt != blank
      assign n_photos = n_photos | plus: 1
    endif
  endfor

  comment
    Sort issues newest first by single_mag.issue_number (direct read in a
    loop, sort: cannot follow the deep metafield path).
  endcomment
  assign nums = ''
  for p in coll.products limit: 50
    assign n = p.metafields.single_mag.issue_number.value | plus: 0
    if n > 0 and p.featured_image
      assign padded = n | prepend: '000' | slice: -3, 3
      assign nums = nums | append: padded | append: ':' | append: p.handle | append: ','
    endif
  endfor
  assign issue_keys = nums | split: ',' | sort | reverse
  assign in_lift = 'the<span class="theinmag-in">IN</span>mag'
  assign h1 = section.settings.heading | escape | replace: 'theINmag', in_lift
-%}

{%- capture dl_icon -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M10 3v10m0 0-4-4m4 4 4-4M4 16h12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>{%- endcapture -%}

<section class="sk" aria-labelledby="sk-h1" data-sk>

  {%- comment -%} Hero: dark ground, big type, the newest covers fanned large {%- endcomment -%}
  <header class="sk-hero">
    <div class="sk-hero__inner">
      <div class="sk-hero__copy">
        <h1 id="sk-h1" class="sk-hero__h1">{{ h1 }}</h1>
        <p class="sk-hero__lede">{{ section.settings.intro }}</p>
        <div class="sk-hero__actions">
          <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--stamp" data-sk-zip="all" data-sk-zip-name="theINmag-stockist-kit" data-sk-confirm="{{ section.settings.kit_size_note | escape }}">{{ dl_icon }}<span>Download the whole kit</span></button>
          {%- if section.settings.kit_size_note != blank -%}<p class="sk-hero__size">{{ section.settings.kit_size_note }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        </div>
        <ol class="sk-hero__index" role="list">
          {%- if section.settings.media_list != blank -%}<li><a href="#sk-photos"><span>01</span>Photos and videos</a></li>{%- endif -%}
          {%- if logos.size > 0 -%}<li><a href="#sk-logos"><span>02</span>Logos</a></li>{%- endif -%}
          <li><a href="#sk-covers"><span>03</span>Covers</a></li>
          {%- if blurbs.size > 0 -%}<li><a href="#sk-words"><span>04</span>Words</a></li>{%- endif -%}
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="sk-hero__stage" aria-hidden="true">
        {%- for key in issue_keys limit: 3 -%}
          {%- assign h = key | split: ':' | last -%}
          {%- assign p = all_products[h] -%}
          <span class="sk-hero__cover sk-hero__cover--{{ forloop.index }}">
            {{ p.featured_image | image_url: width: 760 | image_tag: alt: '', loading: 'eager', widths: '380, 560, 760', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 34vw, 60vw' }}
          </span>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  {%- comment -%}
    01 Photos and videos. Phone first: most of what stockists want is 9:16
    for Instagram stories and reels. Clips sit in a swipeable row of
    vertical tiles (they play only while on screen); photos sit in a
    masonry grid at their true shape, never cropped.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if section.settings.media_list != blank -%}
    <div class="sk-group" id="sk-photos">
      <div class="sk-head">
        <span class="sk-head__num">01</span>
        <h2 class="sk-head__h2">Photos and videos</h2>
        <p class="sk-head__note">{{ section.settings.promo_note }}</p>
      </div>
      {%- comment -%}
        One mixed feed (Ryan, 24 Oct): clips and photos interleaved in block
        order for variety, masonry at each item's true shape. Each item
        downloads on its own; the buttons above zip all photos or all clips.
        Phones show 6 before See all, desktop 12.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="sk-subhead">
        <p class="sk-sub">{{ n_photos }} photos, {{ n_clips }} clips <span class="sk-meta">tap any one to download</span></p>
        <span class="sk-subhead__btns">
          {%- if n_photos > 0 -%}<button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--line sk-btn--sm" data-sk-zip="photos" data-sk-zip-name="theINmag-photos"{% if section.settings.photos_size_note != blank %} data-sk-confirm="{{ section.settings.photos_size_note | escape }}"{% endif %}>{{ dl_icon }}<span>All photos</span></button>{%- endif -%}
          {%- if n_clips > 0 -%}<button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--line sk-btn--sm" data-sk-zip="clips" data-sk-zip-name="theINmag-clips"{% if section.settings.clips_size_note != blank %} data-sk-confirm="{{ section.settings.clips_size_note | escape }}"{% endif %}>{{ dl_icon }}<span>All clips</span></button>{%- endif -%}
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="sk-feed" data-sk-more-list>
      <ul class="sk-masonry" role="list">
        {%- for ml in media_lines -%}
          {%- assign mlt = ml | strip -%}
          {%- if mlt == blank -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign kind = mlt | split: ' ' | first
            assign rest = mlt | remove_first: kind | strip
            assign ref = rest | split: '|' | first | strip
            assign cap = rest | split: '|' | last | strip
            if cap == ref
              assign cap = 'theINmag'
            endif
            assign fname = ref | split: '/' | last | split: '?' | first
          -%}
          {%- if kind == 'clip' -%}
            {%- assign dname = cap | handleize | prepend: 'theINmag-clip-' | append: '.mp4' -%}
            <li class="sk-masonry__item sk-masonry__item--clip" data-sk-group="clips" data-sk-pv="clip" data-sk-pv-src="{{ ref }}" data-sk-pv-name="{{ dname }}" data-sk-pv-cap="{{ cap | escape }}">
              <div class="sk-masonry__media sk-masonry__media--clip">
                {%- comment -%} No poster image (Ryan): the #t fragment shows the clip's own first frame. {%- endcomment -%}
                <video src="{{ ref }}#t=0.1" muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" data-sk-autoplay aria-hidden="true"></video>
                <button type="button" class="sk-pv-hit" data-sk-pv-open aria-label="Preview clip: {{ cap | escape }}"></button>
                <a class="sk-tile-cta sk-tile-cta--on" href="{{ ref }}" download="{{ dname }}" data-sk-file data-sk-name="{{ dname }}">{{ dl_icon }}Clip</a>
              </div>
            </li>
          {%- else -%}
            {%- liquid
              if kind == 'asset'
                assign src = ref | asset_url
                assign thumb = ref | asset_img_url: '900x'
                assign w = ''
                assign h = ''
              else
                assign img = images[ref]
                assign src = img | image_url
                assign thumb = img | image_url: width: 900
                assign w = img.width
                assign h = img.height
              endif
            -%}
            <li class="sk-masonry__item" data-sk-group="photos" data-sk-pv="photo" data-sk-pv-src="{% if kind == 'asset' %}{{ src }}{% else %}{{ img | image_url: width: 1800 }}{% endif %}" data-sk-pv-full="{{ src }}" data-sk-pv-name="{{ fname }}" data-sk-pv-cap="{{ cap | escape }}">
              <a class="sk-masonry__media" href="{{ src }}" download="{{ fname }}" data-sk-file data-sk-name="{{ fname }}" aria-label="Download photo: {{ cap | escape }}">
                <img src="{{ thumb }}" alt="{{ cap | escape }}" loading="lazy"{% if w != blank %} width="{{ w }}" height="{{ h }}"{% endif %}>
                <span class="sk-tile-cta" data-sk-dl>{{ dl_icon }}Photo</span>
              </a>
            </li>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
      </div>
      {%- assign n_media = n_photos | plus: n_clips -%}
      {%- if n_media > 6 -%}
        <button type="button" class="sk-more" data-sk-more aria-expanded="false">See all {{ n_media }}</button>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} 02 Logos: hairline specimen grid {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if logos.size > 0 -%}
    <div class="sk-group" id="sk-logos" data-sk-group="logos">
      <div class="sk-head">
        <span class="sk-head__num">02</span>
        <h2 class="sk-head__h2">Logos</h2>
        <p class="sk-head__note">{{ section.settings.logos_note }}</p>
        <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--line" data-sk-zip="logos" data-sk-zip-name="theINmag-logos">{{ dl_icon }}<span>All logos</span></button>
      </div>
      <ul class="sk-logos" role="list">
        {%- for block in logos -%}
          {%- liquid
            if block.settings.image
              assign src = block.settings.image | image_url
            else
              assign src = block.settings.asset_filename | strip | asset_url
            endif
          -%}
          <li class="sk-logo sk-logo--{{ block.settings.stage }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <a class="sk-logo__link" href="{{ src }}" download="{{ block.settings.download_name }}" data-sk-file data-sk-name="{{ block.settings.download_name }}" aria-label="Download {{ block.settings.label | escape }}">
              <span class="sk-logo__stage"><img src="{{ src }}" alt="{{ block.settings.label | escape }}" loading="lazy"></span>
              <span class="sk-logo__cap"><span>{{ block.settings.label }}</span><span class="sk-logo__dl">{{ dl_icon }}PNG</span></span>
            </a>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} 03 Covers {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="sk-group" id="sk-covers" data-sk-group="covers">
    <div class="sk-head">
      <span class="sk-head__num">03</span>
      <h2 class="sk-head__h2">Covers</h2>
      <p class="sk-head__note">{{ section.settings.covers_note }}</p>
      <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--line" data-sk-zip="covers" data-sk-zip-name="theINmag-covers">{{ dl_icon }}<span>All covers</span></button>
    </div>
    <ul class="sk-covers" role="list">
      {%- for key in issue_keys -%}
        {%- assign h = key | split: ':' | last -%}
        {%- assign p = all_products[h] -%}
        {%- assign n = key | split: ':' | first | plus: 0 -%}
        {%- if n < 10 -%}{%- assign label = 'Mag0' | append: n -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign label = 'Mag' | append: n -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- assign ext = p.featured_image.src | split: '?' | first | split: '.' | last | downcase -%}
        {%- assign is_pre = p.metafields.theinmag.is_pre_order | default: false -%}
        <li class="sk-cover{% if forloop.first %} sk-cover--lead{% endif %}">
          <a class="sk-cover__media" href="{{ p.featured_image | image_url }}" download="theINmag-{{ label }}-cover.{{ ext }}" data-sk-file data-sk-name="theINmag-{{ label }}-cover.{{ ext }}" aria-label="Download the {{ label }} cover">
            {%- if forloop.first -%}
              {{ p.featured_image | image_url: width: 1100 | image_tag: alt: '', loading: 'lazy', widths: '480, 760, 1100', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 46vw, 92vw' }}
            {%- else -%}
              {{ p.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: alt: '', loading: 'lazy', widths: '300, 450, 600', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 22vw, 45vw' }}
            {%- endif -%}
            <span class="sk-tile-cta">{{ dl_icon }}Download</span>
            {%- if is_pre == true -%}<span class="sk-flag">Coming next</span>{%- endif -%}
          </a>
          <div class="sk-cover__cap">
            <span class="sk-cover__name">{{ label }}</span>
            <span class="sk-meta">{{ ext | upcase }} {{ p.featured_image.width }}&thinsp;x&thinsp;{{ p.featured_image.height }}</span>
          </div>
          {%- assign spread_count = 0 -%}
          {%- for m in p.media offset: 1 -%}{%- if m.media_type == 'image' and m.preview_image.width > m.preview_image.height -%}{%- assign spread_count = spread_count | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
          {%- if spread_count > 0 -%}
            <div class="sk-cover__spreads" data-sk-group="spreads-{{ label }}" hidden>
              {%- assign si = 0 -%}
              {%- for m in p.media offset: 1 -%}
                {%- if m.media_type == 'image' and m.preview_image.width > m.preview_image.height -%}
                  {%- assign si = si | plus: 1 -%}
                  <a href="{{ m | image_url }}" data-sk-file data-sk-name="theINmag-{{ label }}-inside-{{ si }}.jpg" tabindex="-1"></a>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- endfor -%}
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="sk-link" data-sk-zip="spreads-{{ label }}" data-sk-zip-name="theINmag-{{ label }}-inside-pages">Inside pages ({{ spread_count }})</button>
          {%- endif -%}
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
      {%- liquid
        comment
          Close the wall with a download tile so no row ends in a hole.
          Desktop (4 columns): the lead cover takes 4 cells. Phone (2 columns):
          it takes 2. --rem-d / --rem-m are the empty cells left on each.
        endcomment
        assign n_covers = issue_keys.size
        assign cells_d = n_covers | plus: 3
        assign rem_d = cells_d | modulo: 4
        assign rem_d = 4 | minus: rem_d | modulo: 4
        assign cells_m = n_covers | plus: 1
        assign rem_m = cells_m | modulo: 2
      -%}
      <li class="sk-cover-fill" style="--rem-d: {{ rem_d }}; --rem-m: {{ rem_m }};" data-rem-d="{{ rem_d }}" data-rem-m="{{ rem_m }}">
        <button type="button" class="sk-cover-fill__btn" data-sk-zip="covers" data-sk-zip-name="theINmag-covers">
          <span class="sk-cover-fill__num">{{ n_covers }}</span>
          <span class="sk-cover-fill__label">covers, one zip</span>
          <span class="sk-cover-fill__go">{{ dl_icon }}<span>Download all</span></span>
        </button>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%} 04 Words: copy to clipboard {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if blurbs.size > 0 -%}
    <div class="sk-group sk-group--tint" id="sk-words">
      <div class="sk-head">
        <span class="sk-head__num">04</span>
        <h2 class="sk-head__h2">Words</h2>
        <p class="sk-head__note">{{ section.settings.words_note }}</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="sk-words" role="list">
        {%- for block in blurbs -%}
          <li class="sk-word" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <p class="sk-word__label">{{ block.settings.label }}</p>
            <p class="sk-word__text" data-sk-copy-text>{{ block.settings.text | escape }}</p>
            <button type="button" class="sk-btn sk-btn--line sk-btn--sm" data-sk-copy>Copy</button>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  <footer class="sk-foot">
    <ul class="sk-foot__rules" role="list">
      {%- assign pts = section.settings.how_points | newline_to_br | split: '<br />' -%}
      {%- for pt in pts -%}{%- assign t = pt | strip -%}{%- if t != blank -%}<li>{{ t | replace: 'heyhey@theinmag.com.au', '<a href="mailto:heyhey@theinmag.com.au">heyhey@theinmag.com.au</a>' | replace: '@the.inmag', '<a href="https://www.instagram.com/the.inmag/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@the.inmag</a>' }}</li>{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </footer>

  <dialog class="sk-lb" data-sk-lb aria-label="Preview">
    <div class="sk-lb__stage" data-sk-lb-stage></div>
    <div class="sk-lb__bar">
      <span class="sk-lb__count" data-sk-lb-count></span>
      <a class="sk-btn sk-btn--stamp sk-btn--sm" data-sk-lb-dl href="#" download>{{ dl_icon }}<span>Download</span></a>
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="sk-lb__nav sk-lb__nav--prev" data-sk-lb-prev aria-label="Previous">&#8592;</button>
    <button type="button" class="sk-lb__nav sk-lb__nav--next" data-sk-lb-next aria-label="Next">&#8594;</button>
    <button type="button" class="sk-lb__close" data-sk-lb-close aria-label="Close preview">&times;</button>
  </dialog>

  <p class="sk-toast" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-sk-toast hidden></p>
</section>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "{{ shop.url }}" },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Stockists", "item": "{{ shop.url }}/pages/instock" },
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": {{ section.settings.heading | json }}, "item": "{{ shop.url }}{{ request.path }}" }
  ]
}
</script>

<script>
  (function () {
    var root = document.querySelector('[data-sk]');
    if (!root) return;
    var toast = root.querySelector('[data-sk-toast]');
    /* Clips play only while on screen, so a phone is never decoding six videos at once. */
    Array.prototype.forEach.call(root.querySelectorAll('[data-sk-more]'), function (b) { b.setAttribute('data-label', b.textContent); });
    var clips = root.querySelectorAll('[data-sk-autoplay]');
    if ('IntersectionObserver' in window && clips.length) {
      var reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
        entries.forEach(function (en) {
          var v = en.target;
          if (en.isIntersecting && !reduce) { v.preload = 'auto'; var pr = v.play(); if (pr && pr.catch) pr.catch(function () {}); }
          else v.pause();
        });
      }, { threshold: 0.5 });
      Array.prototype.forEach.call(clips, function (v) { io.observe(v); });
    }
    var JSZIP = 'https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/jszip/3.10.1/jszip.min.js';
    var zipLib = null;

    function say(msg) {
      if (!toast) return;
      toast.textContent = msg;
      toast.hidden = false;
      clearTimeout(say.t);
      say.t = setTimeout(function () { toast.hidden = true; }, 3200);
    }
    function loadZip() {
      if (window.JSZip) return Promise.resolve(window.JSZip);
      if (zipLib) return zipLib;
      zipLib = new Promise(function (res, rej) {
        var s = document.createElement('script');
        s.src = JSZIP;
        s.onload = function () { res(window.JSZip); };
        s.onerror = rej;
        document.head.appendChild(s);
      });
      return zipLib;
    }
    function filesFor(key) {
      var scope = key === 'all'
        ? root.querySelectorAll('[data-sk-group]')
        : root.querySelectorAll('[data-sk-group="' + key + '"]');
      var out = [], seen = {};
      Array.prototype.forEach.call(scope, function (g) {
        var folder = key === 'all' ? (g.getAttribute('data-sk-group') || '').replace(/^spreads-/, 'covers/inside-') + '/' : '';
        Array.prototype.forEach.call(g.querySelectorAll('[data-sk-file]'), function (a) {
          var href = a.getAttribute('href');
          if (!href || seen[href]) return;
          /* A file belongs to its nearest group only: All covers stays covers
             (spreads have their own buttons), and the whole kit files each
             spread under covers/inside-MagNN once. */
          if (a.closest('[data-sk-group]') !== g) return;
          seen[href] = true;
          out.push({ url: href, name: folder + (a.getAttribute('data-sk-name') || 'theINmag-file') });
        });
      });
      return out;
    }

    /* ---- Preview lightbox (Ryan, 24 Oct): tap a photo or clip to see it
       large; the Photo / Clip tag on a tile still downloads straight away. */
    var lb = root.querySelector('[data-sk-lb]');
    var lbStage = lb && lb.querySelector('[data-sk-lb-stage]');
    var lbDl = lb && lb.querySelector('[data-sk-lb-dl]');
    var lbCount = lb && lb.querySelector('[data-sk-lb-count]');
    var pvItems = Array.prototype.slice.call(root.querySelectorAll('[data-sk-pv]'));
    var pvIndex = 0;
    function showPv(i) {
      if (!lb || !pvItems.length) return;
      pvIndex = (i + pvItems.length) % pvItems.length;
      var it = pvItems[pvIndex];
      var kind = it.getAttribute('data-sk-pv');
      var src = it.getAttribute('data-sk-pv-src');
      var cap = it.getAttribute('data-sk-pv-cap') || '';
      lbStage.innerHTML = '';
      var el;
      if (kind === 'clip') {
        el = document.createElement('video');
        el.src = src; el.controls = true; el.autoplay = true; el.loop = true; el.muted = true; el.playsInline = true;
        el.setAttribute('aria-label', cap);
      } else {
        el = document.createElement('img');
        el.src = src; el.alt = cap;
      }
      lbStage.appendChild(el);
      lbDl.href = it.getAttribute('data-sk-pv-full') || src;
      lbDl.setAttribute('download', it.getAttribute('data-sk-pv-name') || 'theINmag');
      lbDl.querySelector('span').textContent = kind === 'clip' ? 'Download clip' : 'Download photo';
      lbCount.textContent = (pvIndex + 1) + ' of ' + pvItems.length;
    }
    function openPv(i) {
      if (!lb) return;
      showPv(i);
      if (typeof lb.showModal === 'function') lb.showModal(); else lb.setAttribute('open', '');
      document.documentElement.style.overflow = 'hidden';
    }
    function closePv() {
      if (!lb) return;
      if (lb.open && typeof lb.close === 'function') lb.close(); else lb.removeAttribute('open');
      document.documentElement.style.overflow = '';
    }
    if (lb) {
      /* The close event fires after a tick; if a new preview opened in the
         meantime, leave it alone. */
      lb.addEventListener('close', function () { if (lb.open) return; lbStage.innerHTML = ''; document.documentElement.style.overflow = ''; });
      lb.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
        if (e.target === lb || e.target.closest('[data-sk-lb-close]')) { closePv(); return; }
        if (e.target.closest('[data-sk-lb-prev]')) showPv(pvIndex - 1);
        else if (e.target.closest('[data-sk-lb-next]')) showPv(pvIndex + 1);
      });
      lb.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {
        if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft') showPv(pvIndex - 1);
        else if (e.key === 'ArrowRight') showPv(pvIndex + 1);
      });
      var tx = null;
      lb.addEventListener('touchstart', function (e) { tx = e.touches[0].clientX; }, { passive: true });
      lb.addEventListener('touchend', function (e) {
        if (tx === null) return;
        var dx = e.changedTouches[0].clientX - tx; tx = null;
        if (Math.abs(dx) > 50) showPv(pvIndex + (dx < 0 ? 1 : -1));
      });
    }

    root.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
      var pvTile = e.target.closest('[data-sk-pv]');
      if (pvTile && !e.target.closest('[data-sk-dl], .sk-tile-cta')) {
        e.preventDefault();
        openPv(pvItems.indexOf(pvTile));
        return;
      }
      if (pvTile && e.target.closest('[data-sk-dl]')) return; /* tag on a photo: let the link download */
      var copyBtn = e.target.closest('[data-sk-copy]');
      if (copyBtn) {
        var text = copyBtn.parentNode.querySelector('[data-sk-copy-text]').textContent.trim();
        var done = function () { copyBtn.textContent = 'Copied'; setTimeout(function () { copyBtn.textContent = 'Copy'; }, 1800); };
        var fallback = function () {
          var ta = document.createElement('textarea');
          ta.value = text;
          ta.setAttribute('readonly', '');
          ta.style.position = 'fixed';
          ta.style.opacity = '0';
          document.body.appendChild(ta);
          ta.select();
          var ok = false;
          try { ok = document.execCommand('copy'); } catch (err) {}
          ta.remove();
          if (ok) done(); else say('Select the text and copy it.');
        };
        if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(done, fallback);
        else fallback();
        return;
      }
      var moreBtn = e.target.closest('[data-sk-more]');
      if (moreBtn) {
        var list = moreBtn.previousElementSibling;
        var open = list.classList.toggle('is-expanded');
        moreBtn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');
        moreBtn.textContent = open ? 'Show fewer' : moreBtn.getAttribute('data-label');
        if (!open) list.scrollIntoView({ block: 'nearest' });
        return;
      }
      var zipBtn = e.target.closest('[data-sk-zip]');
      if (!zipBtn) return;
      var warn = zipBtn.getAttribute('data-sk-confirm');
      if (warn && !window.confirm(warn + ' Download now?')) return;
      var key = zipBtn.getAttribute('data-sk-zip');
      var files = filesFor(key);
      if (!files.length) return;
      var label = zipBtn.querySelector('span') || zipBtn;
      var was = label.textContent;
      zipBtn.disabled = true;
      label.textContent = 'Packing ' + files.length + ' files';
      loadZip().then(function (JSZip) {
        var zip = new JSZip();
        return Promise.all(files.map(function (f) {
          return fetch(f.url).then(function (r) {
            if (!r.ok) throw new Error(r.status);
            return r.blob();
          }).then(function (b) { zip.file(f.name, b); });
        })).then(function () { return zip.generateAsync({ type: 'blob', compression: 'STORE' }); });
      }).then(function (blob) {
        var a = document.createElement('a');
        a.href = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
        a.download = (zipBtn.getAttribute('data-sk-zip-name') || 'theINmag') + '.zip';
        document.body.appendChild(a);
        a.click();
        setTimeout(function () { URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href); a.remove(); }, 4000);
      }).catch(function () {
        say('That download did not work. Grab the files one by one, or email heyhey@theinmag.com.au.');
      }).then(function () {
        zipBtn.disabled = false;
        label.textContent = was;
      });
    });
  })();
</script>

<style>
  .sk {
    --sk-ink: var(--color-inky-purple-navy, #2A1F3D);
    --sk-paper: var(--color-cream, #FBF6EA);
    --sk-pink: var(--color-soft-pink, #F7A092);
    --sk-rule: rgba(42, 31, 61, 0.14);
    --sk-max: 1320px;
    --sk-gut: clamp(16px, 4vw, 48px);
    background: var(--sk-paper);
    color: var(--sk-ink);
    overflow-x: clip;
  }
  .sk *, .sk *::before, .sk *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .sk img, .sk video { display: block; max-width: 100%; }

  /* Hero */
  .sk-hero { background: var(--sk-ink); color: var(--sk-paper); }
  .sk-hero__inner {
    max-width: var(--sk-max); margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(48px, 8vw, 112px) var(--sk-gut) clamp(40px, 6vw, 96px);
