    { "type": "textarea", "id": "how_points", "label": "Footer rules (one per line)", "default": "Free to use to promote theINmag in your shop, on your site and socials.\nThe creations belong to the kid artists. Never crop or alter them.\nTag @the.inmag when you post and we'll share it.\nNeed something else? Email heyhey@theinmag.com.au." }
